<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">3 DZAÃ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃ytel wa Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Dz</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃ytel wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dzaã</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃tyel wu, ntam Dzaã wu áswɛn ndɛ olieel ndiri ndɛ oli «ɔ̃kuul a Ebvɔɔn» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:1">1</ref></char>). Ndɛ áyuɔɔl ndɛ ol'ɔ̃kiool wɛn nkuũ Ngayihus. Ndɛ ayɛɛn me baal atyel ba: Ngayihus (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:1-8">1-8</ref></char>), Diotilef (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:9-11">9-11</ref></char>) ye Demitiliyus (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:12">12</ref></char>). Ndɛ atam kwɛn awuaal atee b'abetee m'ãkɔɔ ã bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:6-8">6-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngayius oyoo luo olɔ, kɛn a Diotilef obee lɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:9-10">9-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Obobɔ, Dzaã alweel Demitiliyus m'emfa kyɛn «baal bueel y'otaa-taa bam abeyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="3JN 1:12">12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃kuul, mɛ̃ nswɛn yɛ wu Ngayihus, ndoo a dzii, wu nzii mɛ̃ ndyam onse otaa-taa. <verse eid="3JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Ndoo a dzii, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn ãndɔɔ mbueel ãkal ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ bvool kwɛn yɛ kal nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ onge b'eli ɔ̃fel a yɛ kɛɛ-kɛɛ.<verse eid="3JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngayius y'asal a Nziã bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Mɛ̃ eli y'esɛ bibi ŋ'eyi andoo, bu alieel me ndɔɔ otaa-taa b'oli onse yɛ, bvool m'emfa ki ebedzuu yɛ onse otaa-taa. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Esɛ e mɛ̃ ki enduru eli ŋ'eyoo mɛ̃ ndiri baan a mɛ̃ abedzuu onse otaa-taa. <verse eid="3JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Ndoo a mɛ̃ wa dzii, yɛ abesa ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki okiool me ndɔɔ andoo, onkyam me ndɔɔ anzii. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Bɔ ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a dzii e yɛ ke nkwel Ebvɔɔn. Ol'ekal ngesɛ, okɛɛn yɛ buun bɔ bvi eli a bɔ ye kɔɔ me ndɔɔ odzuu o bɔ, m'emfa ki edzii e Nziã. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, otsɛn b'eyɛn bɔ dzwɛ, me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a Mãsia, ki abɔɔ ola baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ bam ebvaan eyɔɔ baal ba bubu, me ndɔɔ yi esal ye bɔ me ndɔɔ otaa-taa.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diotilef ye Demitiliyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Mɛ̃ nswɛn Ebvɔɔn muaan-ɔ̃nkaan, kɛn a Diotilef, wu odzii k'akal mfam onse bakyɛ, k'ayɔɔ bee wɛ. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋ'èya mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èyɛɛn obi b'ebesa ndɛ, ndɛ wu abeyɛɛn ãyɛɛn m'ãbi-ãbi me bee. K'asɛn kɛn oŋɔ̃ wɛ, ndɛ obee hɛ̃ k'ayɔɔ andoo b'abwel, bvool bakyɛ b'adzii k'ayɔɔ bɔ, ndɛ okii bɔ bvool otswɛɛl bɔ onse Ebvɔɔn. <verse eid="3JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Ndoo a dzii, bee obi onɔɔn, nɔɔn kɛn obvɛ. Mbuul wu asa obvɛ oli wa Nziã, wu asa obi k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Me b'otal Demetiliyus, baal bueel y'otaa-taa bam abeyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Bee hɛ̃ eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, b'eyɛɛn bee oli taa-taa.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃lɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'ãndɔɔ bibi m'ekeeswɛn yɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ke nzii k'eswɛn yɛ mɔ̃ m'oswɛn wɛ. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã wɛn mɛ̃ èmwɛn yɛ alili ŋã, obobɔ bia-yɛ èta ɔ̃sam nsɔɔ̃-a-nsɔɔ̃. <verse eid="3JN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Yɔɔl kwɛn opi okal ye yɛ! Andoo b'ali kwɛn abio yɛ. Bio andoo b'ali okɔ m'ɔ̃mɔ̃-ɔ̃mɔ̃.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>